Subject: [PATCH] refactor: replace research engine and complete code quality
 pass

- Replace bundled PaperFlow with a stdlib asyncio research engine.
- Split research API, question-context, start_run and stream_chat hot spots.
- Add characterization tests for routing, run validation and streaming.
- Add ESLint quality ruleset and code quality/review reports with raw scans.
